{"name": "VOID DIVER: Escape from the Abyss", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>'Void Diver: Escape from the Abyss' </strong>is a multiplayer action game that combines beautiful 2.5D pixel art with the high-stakes tension of an extraction RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city you once knew has transformed into a massive dungeon swirling with otherworldly forces. As the manager, you must command 'Divers' as they plunge into this perilous space to recover lost artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, fight, and escape places teeming with aberrations and madness. All for the sake of completing your requests and returning alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COMBAT: Action that Tests Your Limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7ccc5493aa8b612787b747b5c61ca704.poster.avif?t=1787041628\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7ccc5493aa8b612787b747b5c61ca704.webm?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7ccc5493aa8b612787b747b5c61ca704.mp4?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Together or Alone:</strong> Cooperate with up to 3 players to conquer dungeons, or choose to explore the depths as a lone wolf.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Styles:</strong> Choose from a variety of characters, each with unique skills and narratives, to experience different combat styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardboiled Action:</strong> Experience sophisticated, high-impact real-time action set amidst the ruins of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORATION: Secrets of Distorted Space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7236aa4605f1b6478069efeef6b05870.poster.avif?t=1787041628\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7236aa4605f1b6478069efeef6b05870.webm?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7236aa4605f1b6478069efeef6b05870.mp4?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/c5d7501e9736d0a2aff61885fde2c50e.poster.avif?t=1787041628\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/c5d7501e9736d0a2aff61885fde2c50e.webm?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/c5d7501e9736d0a2aff61885fde2c50e.mp4?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Otherworldly City:</strong> Explore bizarre spatial structures where familiar cityscapes have fused with another dimension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Artifact Recovery:</strong> Your primary goal is to find hidden valuables\u2014super-scientific devices, forbidden magic relics, and more\u2014and escape safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVAL: Madness and Curses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/425f74941bd1fda59bf7e6094b05bd02.poster.avif?t=1787041628\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/425f74941bd1fda59bf7e6094b05bd02.webm?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/425f74941bd1fda59bf7e6094b05bd02.mp4?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Threats:</strong> Fight against otherworldly monsters, rampaging machines, urban legends, and humans driven to madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mental Pressure:</strong> Dungeons consume not just the body, but the mind. Manage the stress that leads to strange phenomena when it hits its limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Paradox Curse:</strong> Survival includes finding cures for 'Paradoxes'\u2014dreadful curses that linger even after an expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GROWTH: Build Your Own Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/99d9b483a5039f25e81ac4db63aab69e.poster.avif?t=1787041628\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/99d9b483a5039f25e81ac4db63aab69e.webm?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/99d9b483a5039f25e81ac4db63aab69e.mp4?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Development:</strong> Combine exclusive skill trees and traits to maximize your character's potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gear Customization:</strong> Create a unique build using countless weapons, accessories, and relics obtained from the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANAGEMENT: Antique Store \u2018BALUSHA\u2019</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7602ae418fff764e9c4956a94e61a57a.poster.avif?t=1787041628\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7602ae418fff764e9c4956a94e61a57a.webm?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438920/extras/7602ae418fff764e9c4956a94e61a57a.mp4?t=1787041628\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop Management:</strong> Run the antique shop \u2018BALUSHA\u2019 in the heart of a city where anomalies have become daily life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Merchant:</strong> Support Divers and grow your business by trading artifacts. As you deal in forbidden relics, the city's dark secrets will slowly be revealed.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Manage 'BALUSHA' antique shop in an anomalous city. Command 'Divers' into the abyss to recover artifacts from city dungeons. Survive and escape alive in this high-quality pixel art extraction action RPG. Face bizarre threats alone or with friends.", "header_image": "https://sh